msgid "The festival commemorates the rededication of the Second Temple in Jerusalem."
msgstr "The festival commemorates the rededication of the Second Temple in Jerusalem."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/diwali.tsx:90
msgid "The festival is also one of the biggest shopping seasons in India, with markets staying open late and fireworks continuing well past midnight."
msgstr "The festival is also one of the biggest shopping seasons in India, with markets staying open late and fireworks continuing well past midnight."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/earth-day.tsx:50
msgid "The first Earth Day, held in 1970, grew out of environmental activism and nationwide teach-ins across the United States."
msgstr "The first Earth Day, held in 1970, grew out of environmental activism and nationwide teach-ins across the United States."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/eid-al-fitr.tsx:67
msgid "The first meal of Eid, eaten after a month of fasting, carries a significance that's hard to overstate — it's often dates and something sweet, shared before the morning prayer."
msgstr "The first meal of Eid, eaten after a month of fasting, carries a significance that's hard to overstate — it's often dates and something sweet, shared before the morning prayer."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/geminids.tsx:52
msgid "The Geminids are one of the strongest and most reliable meteor showers of the year, appearing each December with frequent, bright meteors."
msgstr "The Geminids are one of the strongest and most reliable meteor showers of the year, appearing each December with frequent, bright meteors."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/eid-al-adha.tsx:43
msgid "The holiday commemorates the story of Ibrahim and his willingness to sacrifice in obedience to God."
msgstr "The holiday commemorates the story of Ibrahim and his willingness to sacrifice in obedience to God."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/valentines.tsx:33
msgid "The holiday draws on legends of Saint Valentine and the traditions of medieval courtly love."
msgstr "The holiday draws on legends of Saint Valentine and the traditions of medieval courtly love."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/christmas.tsx:34
msgid "The holiday we recognise today grew from early Christian tradition, layered over much older European midwinter customs tied to light, renewal, and community."
msgstr "The holiday we recognise today grew from early Christian tradition, layered over much older European midwinter customs tied to light, renewal, and community."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/leonids.tsx:52
msgid "The Leonids are a November meteor shower, named for their radiant in the constellation Leo."
msgstr "The Leonids are a November meteor shower, named for their radiant in the constellation Leo."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/leonids.tsx:68
msgid "The Leonids are renowned for historic meteor storms, most notably in 1833 and 1966, when observers described the sky as seeming to rain stars."
msgstr "The Leonids are renowned for historic meteor storms, most notably in 1833 and 1966, when observers described the sky as seeming to rain stars."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/leonids.tsx:85
msgid "The Leonids originate from Comet Tempel–Tuttle, and every few decades Earth passes through especially dense streams of its debris."
msgstr "The Leonids originate from Comet Tempel–Tuttle, and every few decades Earth passes through especially dense streams of its debris."

#: src/features/settings/ui/initialisation.tsx:178
msgid "The location request timed out - this looks like a service issue rather than a problem on your end. Please try again in a moment."
msgstr "The location request timed out - this looks like a service issue rather than a problem on your end. Please try again in a moment."

#: src/features/settings/ui/initialisation.tsx:186
msgid "The location request timed out. Please check your internet connection and try again."
msgstr "The location request timed out. Please check your internet connection and try again."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/lyrids.tsx:52
msgid "The Lyrids appear each year in late April, with meteors radiating from the constellation Lyra."
msgstr "The Lyrids appear each year in late April, with meteors radiating from the constellation Lyra."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/day-of-the-dead.tsx:73
msgid "The marigold paths (cempasúchil) aren't just decorative. Their strong scent is believed to guide the dead back to the living world for the night."
msgstr "The marigold paths (cempasúchil) aren't just decorative. Their strong scent is believed to guide the dead back to the living world for the night."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/earth-day.tsx:82
msgid "The math is oddly encouraging — the trees planted on Earth Day since 1970 now number in the billions."
msgstr "The math is oddly encouraging — the trees planted on Earth Day since 1970 now number in the billions."

